The code computes all the possible trajectories deriving from the intervals of all the variables. Discards all the trajectory that cannot reach our final goal and sorts all the other ones finding the one that has the minimum fuel consumption. We can assume that to minimize the velocity to close the last orbit, we must enter with the minimum possible energy, so with a quasi-parabolic trajectory,in fact the eccentricity of the last hyperbolic trajectory is $e=1.5$.
